      "role": "user",
      "content": "A punctuation mark... yeah. That's exactly it. Like the story just ran out of ink. I look at the steel and I don't even see a weapon anymore, just something cold and certain. It's the only thing in this whole world that isn't lying to me right now. Everything else was a dream, but this? This is real. It's the only thing that feels like it could actually end the weight of it all.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
